  "body": "\u003cp\u003eI have date \u003ccode\u003eWed May 08 00:00:00 GMT+06:30 2013\u003c/code\u003e. I add one day into it by using \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.joda.org/joda-time/\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer\"\u003eJoda-Time\u003c/a\u003e \u003ca href\u003d\"https://www.joda.org/joda-time/apidocs/org/joda/time/DateTime.html\" rel\u003d\"noreferrer\"\u003eDateTime\u003c/a\u003e like this.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;\u003cpre\u003e\u003ccode\u003eDateTime dateTime \u003d new DateTime(date);\u0026#xA;dateTime.plusDays(1);\u0026#xA;\u003c/code\u003e\u003c/pre\u003e\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;\u003cp\u003eWhen I print dateTime, I got this date \u003ccode\u003e2013-05-08T00:00:00.000+06:30\u003c/code\u003e. The joda date time didn\u0027t add one day. I haven\u0027t found any error.\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#xA;\u0026#xA;\u003cp\u003eThanks\u003c/p\u003e\u0026#xA;",
